  "ingredients": [
    "1 pound chicken livers",
    "1 egg",
    "0.5 cup milk",
    "1 cup all-purpose flour",
    "1 tablespoon garlic powder",
    "salt and pepper to taste",
    "1 quart vegetable oil for frying"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/d-DjIeH7CAQUmixI-cgpml-Qe54=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/200036-southern-fried-chicken-livers-step-01-4x3-46c3495aff604a3b8a8d1865de9353f6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/200036/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place chicken livers in a colander; rinse with cold water and drain well. Blot dry with paper towels.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ch4LhGV6Sk86IdLDR1liRTyEQ4g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/200036-southern-fried-chicken-livers-step-02-4x3-d6652d0267f7405280a9d5e64a7dd479.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/200036/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk egg and milk together in a shallow dish until blended.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TcIdXQQmJ8y3Pmt-dxxJvsR66WY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/200036-southern-fried-chicken-livers-step-03-2-4x3-b6e80a799e38462bbad2c9aa0dfb08c3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/200036/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place flour, garlic powder, salt, and pepper into a zip-top bag; shake to combine. Heat oil in a deep fryer or large saucepan to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uZQDfDqAMrBBS3MZwRC4RlvHFPA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/200036-southern-fried-chicken-livers-step-04-4x3-6846ea26d2ef47738b0f68ec23680c74.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/200036/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dip chicken livers in egg mixture to coat, then transfer, one at a time, into flour mixture, shaking the bag to coat completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jwgNgbZAfv8RUWcqCVs3GXt6Dw4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/200036-southern-fried-chicken-livers-step-05-4x3-50282aacf7a843cf8b04297f342914b0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/200036/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gently place coated livers, a few at a time, into hot oil; cover with a splatter screen and cook until crisp and golden brown, 5 to 6 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JVQvZOsnMUFCfPD4HySpHM5ht-E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/200036-southern-fried-chicken-livers-step-06-4x3-e55670fef8e341ed95fb69e4917fcc1a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/200036/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve with your choice of dip. Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rSnZMRlV58dB4mMeWYoH5NT4oa8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/200036-southern-fried-chicken-livers-hero-4x3-c911bb3a874a4e26b5f3b12b3ad34f25.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/200036/step_07.webp"
    }
  ],
